  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "DSLO_v0.6_Semantic_Substrate_Specification.pdf",
  "description": "\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDSLO v0.6 \u2014 Semantic Substrate Specification\n\t\n\n\nSubstrate Lineage Notice \u2014 DSLO v0.5 \u2192 v0.6 \u2192 v0.7\nDSLO v0.6 inherits its semantic substrate from DSLO v0.5, and serves as the hard\u2011artifact surface for DSLO research.\nDSLO v0.7 is the semantic substrate mirror that extends DSLO v0.6 for manifold\u2011level interpretation.\nLineage: DSLO v0.5 \u2190 DSLO v0.6 \u2192 DSLO v0.7\nSuccessor Substrate Mirror: DSLO v0.7 \u2014 Semantic Substrate Specification\nMirror DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.21865818\nMirror\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/DSLO/DSLO_v0.6_Semantic_Substrate_Specification.pdf.",
